# Unit tests (analytics.admin)

Write unit tests for new behavior (colocated `*.test.ts` / `*.test.tsx`). After changes, run `pnpm test` in `analytics.admin` and do not leave a failing suite.

Use [`renderWithProviders`](analytics.admin/src/shared/lib/test/render-with-providers.tsx) for components that need Mantine / QueryClient.

```tsx
import { renderWithProviders } from '@/shared/lib/test/render-with-providers'

it('renders empty state', () => {
  renderWithProviders(<DataTable columns={columns} items={[]} />)
})
```

Form fields: wrap with `useForm` and pass `control`. Do not skip tests for shared UI primitives.
